    "detailed_description": "This is the planned construction site for the burger shop.<br>Alice was fired up.<br>She's going to make this store a thriving business, she said.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prepare a variety of menus</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831340/extras/2b32b608a276e47b383c758347b437ef.poster.avif?t=1688371641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831340/extras/2b32b608a276e47b383c758347b437ef.webm?t=1688371641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831340/extras/2b32b608a276e47b383c758347b437ef.mp4?t=1688371641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831340/extras/7a673559f6472191bab75489546ad976.avif?t=1688371641\" /></div><br>\u30fbIt is a simulation game that manages a burger shop.<br>\u30fbIncrease the floor area of the shop, and select and place tables, chairs, and decorations<br>- Employ and assign employees. Employees grow and improve their proficiency through work<br>\u30fbDevelop the menu to be provided<br>\u30fbRaise your reputation and aim for a popular store<br>\u30fbDifferent customers have different favorite dishes and interior decorations<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bustling shop</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831340/extras/f99c85b517b6251c446bf9bfbd9361d1.poster.avif?t=1688371641\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1831340/extras/f99c85b517b6251c446bf9bfbd9361d1.webm?t=1688371641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/